msgid ""
"To add or remove titlebar buttons, simply <i>drag</i> "
"items between the available item list and the titlebar preview. Similarly, drag "
"items within the titlebar preview to re-position them."
msgstr ""
"Na voeg by of verwyder titelbar knoppies, eenvoudig <i>trek</i> "
"iteme tussen die beskikbaar item lys en die titelbar voorskou. Soortgelyk, trek "
"iteme binne in die titelbar voorskou Na re-position hulle."

